From: Kumar-Jy <kumar@nabu>
Subject: [PATCH] libssc: use gulong for the base sensor report handler id

The nabu lifecycle patch switches the per-sensor report_id fields to
gulong so g_clear_signal_handler() can take their address. The base
SSCSensorPrivate in src/libssc-sensor.c was missed, which fails to
compile against glib >= 2.80 with -Wincompatible-pointer-types.

diff --git a/src/libssc-sensor.c b/src/libssc-sensor.c
--- a/src/libssc-sensor.c
+++ b/src/libssc-sensor.c
@@ -57,7 +57,7 @@
 	gfloat mount_matrix[3][3];
 
 	SSCClient *client;
-	guint report_id;
+	gulong report_id;
 	gboolean attr_populated;
 	gboolean service_available;
 	guint service_retries;
